           END-CALL
           CALL "GET_RESULT" USING BY REFERENCE WS-RESULT END-CALL
           MOVE WS-RESULT(1:64) TO WS-CHECKSUM
           MOVE SPACES TO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER
           IF WS-STORED = WS-CHECKSUM
               STRING "SUCCESS|CEX_VERIFY|OK|" DELIMITED BY SIZE WS-P1-TRIMMED DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER END-STRING
           ELSE
               MOVE "ERROR|MISMATCH" TO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER
           END-IF.
           EXIT PARAGRAPH.

       ACTION-SUMMARY.
           PERFORM ALLOW-ADMIN
           IF WS-ALLOWED NOT = 1
               MOVE "ERROR|FORBIDDEN" TO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF.
           MOVE "SELECT CONCAT(COUNT(*), '|', COALESCE(SUM(status = 'DRAFT'), 0), '|', COALESCE(SUM(status = 'SEALED'), 0), '|', COALESCE(SUM(status = 'ATTESTED'), 0), '|', COALESCE(SUM(status = 'REVOKED'), 0)) FROM compliance_export_package" TO WS-PREP-SQL
           CALL "SQL_PREPARE_EXEC" USING BY REFERENCE WS-PREP-SQL BY VALUE 0
               BY REFERENCE WS-BIND-1 BY REFERENCE WS-BIND-2 BY REFERENCE WS-BIND-3
               BY REFERENCE WS-BIND-4 BY REFERENCE WS-BIND-5 BY REFERENCE WS-BIND-6
           END-CALL
           CALL "GET_RESULT" USING BY REFERENCE WS-RESULT END-CALL
           IF WS-RESULT(1:5) = "ERROR"
               MOVE "ERROR|DB_ERROR" TO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF.
           MOVE SPACES TO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER
           STRING "SUCCESS|CEX_SUMMARY|" DELIMITED BY SIZE WS-RESULT(1:200) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER END-STRING.
           EXIT PARAGRAPH.
